  "description": "Since childhood, Do-Kyung has been plagued by lingering spirits drawn to his strong yin energy - a curse that only worsens with age. Cornered by malicious ghosts, he’s saved by Yoon-Je, a powerful spirit radiating yang energy. But Yoon-Je doesn’t offer his help for free. “I’ll share my energy with you if you share yours with me.” Caught in an unusual pact, Do-Kyung must navigate this strange exchange while fending off the feelings that begin to creep into his heart. Can their balance keep the darkness at bay?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Part of Bomtoon’s and Lezhin’s Saekgwi Danpyeonseon (색귀 단편선) Collection or Dirty Demon Collection in English.*",
